Scope of this repository
===============================================================================
This repository contains ONLY an independent compatibility fix authored by the
project contributors:
  * a one-line patch to the DKMS Makefile shipped by the vendor driver package
    (patches/), and
  * helper scripts and documentation (scripts/, README.md).

It does NOT contain, and does not redistribute, any part of the Lisuan (砺算)
GPU driver, its closed-source object blobs, its user-mode libraries, or the
`.deb` packages. Those remain the property of their respective owners and must
be obtained from the vendor / OEM by the end user (see README.md).

